  "text": {
    "en": {
      "text": "Passively grants -200 Blast Radius, 25% decreased damage, and 15% decreased detonation radius.\n\nEnemies within 6 meters of the explosion are disoriented for 4.5 seconds. Disorient radius cannot be increased using other perks.\n\n<link Champions and Bosses [#CombatantClassifications] /> are unaffected by Disorient.\n\n(Disorient is effectively the equivalent of <arc/>Arc Blind without any of the elemental synergies and anti-champion benefits)\n\nPlayers near the explosion briefly lose their HUD and have their screen distorted for up to ? seconds. Duration varies depending on the distance from the blast.",
      "updatedAt": "2026-06-27T22:18:56.458Z",
      "updatedBy": "Hawkmoona"
    }
  },
